{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41173","headline":"行经太华 · 孔德绍","name":"行经太华","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纷吾世网暇，灵岳展幽寻。\n寥廊风尘远，杳冥川谷深。\n山昏五里雾，日落二华阴。\n疎峰起莲叶，危塞隐桃林。\n何必东都外，此处可抽簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔德绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}